{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16751","headline":"谪居汉阳白沙口阻雨因题驿亭 · 郑常","name":"谪居汉阳白沙口阻雨因题驿亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉阳无远近，见说过湓城。\n云雨经春客，江山几日程。\n终随鸥鸟去，秖待海潮生。\n前路逢渔父，多惭问姓名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16751.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16751","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}